WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:05,500
Are you too realistic?

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,500
The spiritual herbs you stole before were all planted by me.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,560
This medicine field is already in short supply.

4
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,560
It’s rare to grow into a few ectoplasms

5
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,560
Not much spiritual power at all

6
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,560
You'd better change to something with more spiritual energy.

7
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:20,060
little ancestor

8
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:22,060
All I have is possessions

9
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:28,960
Take it as a compliment

10
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,960
Changing faces faster than flipping through a book

11
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:33,150
I think he recognized you

12
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:38,380
Tuyuan, you are lazy again

13
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:40,640
Brother Tu, I am not lazy

14
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:43,790
Isn’t this the Xianxin Fighting Spirit Beast?

15
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:46,340
You said you were not lazy

16
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,340
I don’t know what important business Brother Tu has here today.

17
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:50,340
I and Senior Brother Gu are about to inspect the medicine fields.

18
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,340
If something goes wrong with this medicine field

19
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:54,340
I'm afraid it's hard to explain things to the manager.
